// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3223276625" "Cerulean"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1396414030" "<shout>{HeroName}, come, the ritual has begun."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2275253406" "Hello there son"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P740127043" "<shout>Sha-na-to-re-ma-tu-na.<em>Vo-ku-ra-te-la-sha-ra.<em>Su-ver-na Ta-may Ar-ka-nus."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1724074688" "<shout>I dare, Diabolique."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1543203373" "<shout>That was a long time ago, Tammy..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1843311813" "<shout>Not long enough ago for me to forget how you murdered your father and abandoned the Midnight Squad."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1662354680" "<shout>Midnight is another matter!<em>Tell me why you're summoning the Apparitions now or I'll be forced to..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2958120058" "<shout>Charade?!<em>Oh no!<em>{HeroName}, the ward has no power over her!<em>She's been free this entire time!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P326157038" "Shadow of Diabolique"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P3669930348" "This is but a shadow of the arch-villain Diabolique's full power."
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P3619703746" "Let us see how much power you possess."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1057747068" "Impressive.<em>Most impressive."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2183911268" "Let's see how you fare against others I've taken."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P385215759" "Perhaps it is you who I should enslave to my will."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P361897847" "Another feeble soul undeserving of my attentions."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P684418594" "<shout>Who<em>DARES<em>Summon me?!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P394102851" "<shout>Cerulean!<em>It has been far, far too long... lover."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2651282748" "<shout>Not so long ago for you to forget my name, I see.<em>Or my affections?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4085222214" "<shout>Ah yes, father and the Midnighters.<em>They didn't fare too well after I left.<em>I had wondered if that insect, Master Midnight, had killed you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2918205539" "<shout>Or you'll be forced to WHAT?<em>Destroy me?<em>By all means, Cerulean.<em>If you aren't going to speak civilly with me then I see no reason to keep up this charade of powerlessness..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4020873752" "<shout>Your feeble magic can't even contain a splinter of my power, Cerulean.<em>And to think, I was once your naive, affectionate pupil.<em>It would seem that now it is you who are in need of a master."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1877281366" "<shout>Very good, {HeroName}.<em>You are powerful. I must have you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3146928961" "<shout>It would seem that {HeroName} is not without {hero.gender=male his|her} uses.<t 4>If you wish to speak about the Apparitions, civilly, then meet me in person atop the Westerman Building in the center of the Sunken City.<t 4>And don't bring Cerulean, he is no longer of any use, or interest, to me."

