// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P278573775" "Relive the memory of an Apparition"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1771387839" "Go ahead, {HeroName}. See what horrors this poor soul has had visited upon it and you will see true evil at work."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2214997635" "Unfamiliar sights and sounds take shape and then feel frighteningly familiar. The memory of disinfectant pulls disconnected thoughts together and you recall that this is a hospital."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P847918003" "(Click on the doctor to see the next memory)"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3213035486" "(Click on the prisoner to see the next memory)"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2955042311" "(Click on the apparition to see the next memory)"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P41442942" "Nice Doctor I Never Met Again"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2974898665" "Well, well, well. It looks like I have a new patient, and so pretty too.<t 4>What's your name sweetheart?<t 4>Hmmm, not very talkative, huh?<t 4>That's okay, you don't have to talk unless you want to.<t 4>How about you come with me while I show you to your room and I'll talk while you listen.<t 4>Does that sound ok?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2226957662" "Medical Staff"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P656337420" "Security"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P56449871" "I Am Me"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4264505104" "<shout>I want to go back to my family.<t 4>Why are you doing this to me? I didn't do anything wrong!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P832951672" "Doctor Kind"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1178877458" "<shout>Come now dear, we're all here to help you.<t 4>Nobody is going to hurt you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2853351920" "Do you know who Praetor Tilman is?<t 4>She wants to meet you. She wants to help you too."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2749262970" "Is That Me?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1069526870" "Who am I?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1884099656" "<shout>What is going on?<t 4>Why can I see myself on that operating table?<t 4>Why won't anyone TALK TO ME!?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1044931991" "Praetor Crazy"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1216938212" "<shout>Shhh, swallow those tears little one, Mother loves you.<t 4>All the pain, the sorrow, Mother will make it go away."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2150565263" "<shout>Thank you, -Doctor Serious-, but Mother knows exactly what she's doing.<t 4>Mother is making all this precious little girl's fears just... disappear."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4045177287" "Doctor Serious"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P847232370" "<shout>Heart rate falling back into normal parameters.<t 5>You can continue the psychic surgery, Mother."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P244901103" "Seer"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3656968613" "Praetor Tilman"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2034002237" "<shout>All of Mother's daughters, sleeping soundly in their beds.<t 4>So precious. Their dreams filled with happiness."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3477368198" "<shout>Patience, -Doctor Scary-, patience.<t 4>Some thoughts of rebellion still exist in this one, and Mother strongly dislikes disobedient children.<t 4>Prepare her for another session of psychic surgery. No trace of this malcontent can be allowed to linger."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3846119918" "Doctor Scary"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3062488623" "<shout>Mother. When do you wish to begin network integration on this one?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3369027290" "<shout><t 8><t 2>My pleasure."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1075323280" "What am I?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3844297292" "<shout>What have you DONE TO ME!?!<t 4>I HATE you! I hate you ALL!<t 2>GIVE.<t 2>ME.<t 2>BACK.<t 2>MY!<t 2>BODY!<t 4>TALK TO ME! PLEASE!<t 4>SOMEONE TALK TO ME!!!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P985705738" "Are you me?"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1389900715" "Ripped Spectre"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1565141382" "What are you doing here, {HeroName}?!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2413571489" "There's no room for you here. No room for anything or anyone anymore!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1124066280" "No room for Mother's love!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P4025054709" "Nothing but fear! Nothing but anger!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P1636110632" "What would you do to escape this?! What would you do to survive?"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P818098302" "I told you, there is no room for anyone... I'm so alone."

