// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P291657906" "You have acquired detailed medical records and analysis from the Asylum Archives proving that the Apparitions are created by Praetor Tilman's Seer Program."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3610340205" "You downloaded secret data from the Asylum computers involving the Seer Program and Praetor Tilman's questionable practices during their transformation from unstable psychic to obedient seer."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2_Part5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3486939822" "Discuss with Diabolique what you have discovered"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P450296653" "Diabolique must have some insight on your findings. Speak with her first and then return to me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1917207929" "You discussed your own findings with those of Diabolique. She told you that a powerful and kindred magic lay dormant on the Apparitions and then dismissed you to share what you've learned with Cerulean."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4022088497" "The Apparitions are created by the Seer Program!?<br><br>This is horrifying!<br><br>Tilman is cutting out the strongest emotional parts of people's personalities and discarding them like trash. The result is an obedient seer, loyal to <i>Mother</i> and willing to obey her every command.<br><br>I thought what Diabolique did was bad, but at least she has the decency to kill you before enslaving your eternal soul, Tilman is butchering people's psyches and keeping them alive in a living hell!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CeruleanDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1936317986" "<color orange>Cerulean seems to lose consciousness for the briefest of moments and then recovers his balance.</color><br><br>Ugh... What was THAT?"
// Answer Text :
"P3835870299" "Cerulean?"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P2120216832" "<color orange>Cerulean concentrates for a moment before looking to you with his blazing blue eyes, concern in his voice.</color><br><br>Something... something is happening with the Apparitions. It's the enchantment on them, it's activating!"
// Answer Text :
"P1957652412" "What do you need me to do?"
// Page Page3 Text :
"P2324874847" "It's powerful!<br><br>{HeroName}, you must get to Tammy, I fear she is in grave danger!"
// Answer Text :
"P1817107750" "You want me to save her?!"
// Page Page4 Text :
"P4250607085" "This is no time for foolish quarrels over past deeds, there is a great evil moving and I fear that I cannot oppose it alone!<br><br>Get to Tammy and bring her here before it is too late!"
// Answer Text :
"P3869317996" "Alright, I'm going. (Enter Mission)"
// Answer Text :
"P3732433183" "I need a moment to prepare. (Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MasterMidnightDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1588821433" "I'm here not to do battle, but to offer you a proposition. What say you?"
// Answer Text :
"P1651519341" "I'm listening"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1577190988" "From the sound of it, Diabolique has discovered that there is more than Mother Mayhem's psychotic powers at work here, that there's magic as well and she is uncertain of the source. Her... <i>offer</i> for me to join her was just a masked cry for help for her old teacher. Tell her thanks for the offer, but no thanks. I'll look into this <i>kindred</i> magic on my own, meanwhile I think whatever it is that is going on has Diabolique concerned enough that she isn't looking to make more enemies. This might be the best chance we have of getting close to her. See if you can gain her trust before the winds change and she turns on you."
// AcceptString :
"P4289950211" "I'll do what I can."
// SendOffString :
"P2998122430" "One more thing, {HeroName}. Diabolique isn't easily put on the defensive. <color orange>If this magic that she's discovered is making her cautious, understand that the source of it probably isn't friendly to you either.</color><br><br>Right now the best chance we have is to work together with Diabolique and eliminate the greater of two evils. Just be ready for the backlash once the greater threat is eliminated or you may find yourself enslaved to her will for the rest of eternity."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P534343048" "<color deepskyblue>Part Five: The Devil Is In The Details.</color>"

