// 10 Actor2 :
"P1216264609" "I can feel your presence, Sorcerer... show yourself!"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P1063320211" "Tammy Arcanus..."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2649292538" "...it's been a long, long time..."
// 10 Actor2 :
"P3150405603" "<em=laugh>Clarissa...!?!<t 2>I knew the enchantments upon the Apparitions were familiar...<t 3>Tell me, when the Emperor ordered me to destroy your Cabal, how long did you weep for them?"
// 10 Actor1 :
"P3468894077" "The name is Serene now, Tammy.<t 4>And the fact that the enchantments were familiar should have been the first sign for you to be cautious..."
// 10 Actor1 :
"P2711444736" "<em=lecture>But I knew that you would ignore the warning in your mind.<t 5>I knew that your arrogance would prevent you from recognizing that the spell of binding placed upon the Apparitions was the very same you used to enslave MY coven..."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P1429796375" "<em=point>...AND your own father!"
// 10 Actor2 :
"P636658041" "They're mine, 'Serene'.<t 2>ALL mine. Forever.<t 2>And soon you will be too.<t 4>Your spell is a failure. It isn't even complete."
// 3 Actor1 :
"P1063881234" "If that is true..."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P288916844" "Then why is it that the Apparitions obey my commands and not your own?"
// 12 Actor2 :
"P2026669307" "<em=lecture>They are bound to MY will, 'Serene', completely and eternally. And soon, so shall you!<t 3>I'm overjoyed. The destruction of the Ravenwing Cabal is finally complete!<t 4><em=point>Minions! Bring her soul to me!"
